msgstr "无法清除 WAN 区域日志选项。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:757
msgid "Could not create a temporary file for rule names."
msgstr "无法为规则名称创建临时文件。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:944
msgid "Could not disable logging."
msgstr "无法禁用日志记录。"

