msgstr "启用日志仅开启 WAN 区域的丢弃/拒绝日志记录（同 网络 → 防火墙），不会添加规则，也不会记录正常的 LAN 浏览。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:96
msgid "Enabling…"
msgstr "正在启用…"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1913
msgid "Exclude"
msgstr "排除"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/chips.js:93
