#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1677
msgid "Firewall log has no current entries; showing rows last received %s ago."
msgstr "防火墙日志当前没有条目；显示的是 %s 前收到的日志行。"

