#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:353
msgid "If the WAN is quiet, wait for probes or use the optional ping check in Help / the enabling-logs guide."
msgstr "如果 WAN 侧较安静，请等待探测报文，或使用「帮助」/启用日志指南中的可选 ping 检查。"

